msgid ""
"%(matching_images_count)s matching images have been found for %"
"(product_count)s products."
msgstr ""
"Намерени са %(matching_images_count)s съответстващи изображения за %"
"(product_count)s продукта."

#. module: product_barcodelookup
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:product_barcodelookup.product_fetch_image_wizard_view_form
msgid ""
"<span invisible=\"nb_products_selected &lt;= 1000\">\n"
"                            As only 1000 products can be processed per day, "
"the remaining will be\n"
"                            done tomorrow.\n"
"                        </span>"
msgstr ""
"<span invisible=\"nb_products_selected &lt;= 1000\">\n"
"                            Тъй като само 1000 продукта могат да бъдат "
"обработени на ден, останалите ще\n"
"                            бъдат обработени утре.\n"
"                        </span>"

#. module: product_barcodelookup
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:product_barcodelookup.product_fetch_image_wizard_view_form
msgid ""
"<strong>Note: </strong>\n"
"                        Some images may not be royalty-free and should not "
"be published online."
msgstr ""
"<strong>Бележка: </strong>\n"
"                        Някои изображения може да не са свободни от авторски "
"права и не бива да се публикуват онлайн."

